,{"t":" "},{"t":"who","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"has","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"no","s":["H5060"]},{"t":" help,"}]},{"n":5,"text":"set apart among the dead, like the slain who lie in the grave, whom you remember no more. They are cut off from your hand.","tok":[{"t":"set apart "},{"t":"among","s":["H5973"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" dead, "},{"t":"like","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" slain "},{"t":"who","s":["H1397"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"lie","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" grave, "},{"t":"whom","s":["H1397"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H5973"]},{"t":" remember "},{"t":"no","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"more","s":["H1961"]},{"t":". They "},{"t":"are","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H3381"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"from","s":["H3381"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" hand."}]},{"n":6,"text":"You have laid me in the lowest pit, in the darkest depths.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"laid","s":["H7901"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H4191"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H2142"]},{"t":" lowest pit, "},{"t":"in","s":["H4191"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H2142"]},{"t":" darkest depths."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Your wrath lies heavily on me. You have afflicted me with all your waves. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"Your","s":["H7896"]},{"t":" wrath lies heavily on "},{"t":"me","s":["H7896"]},{"t":". You have afflicted "},{"t":"me","s":["H7896"]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"all","s":["H7896"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H7896"]},{"t":" waves. Selah."}]},{"n":8,"text":"You have taken my friends from me. You have made me an abomination to them. I am confined, and I can’t escape.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" taken "},{"t":"my","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" friends "},{"t":"from","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H5921"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"You",